From 072f903c879976eb3a1bc42928c8e115691049d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 19 Jul 2026 14:09:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kof): add AI opponent, mode select, and mobile/desktop
 responsive support

- Add start menu to choose 2-player mode or vs-AI mode (Easy/Normal/Hard)
- Implement AI opponent driving player 2: approaches, attacks in range,
  retreats, jumps and dodges, with difficulty-tuned reaction/aggression,
  reusing the existing player state machine
- Add responsive equal-ratio scaling of the 1280x720 stage to fit any
  viewport (mobile + desktop), keeping 16:9
- Add game-over/result screen with winner detection, rematch and back-to-menu,
  plus clean match teardown/restart so objects don't stack
- Keep existing PvP keyboard controls and touch controls working

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017oquF8ugsspuVW2sLyjfDw
